'''''An Unexpected Turn of Events''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[The Dawn After the Dark (Companion Mission Chapter)|The Dawn After the Dark]].

==Steps==
# Find out more details from Asta
# Follow Peppy
# Fish information out of Professor Capote
# Talk to Capote's fans
# Pass on all the clues you learned to Asta
# Keep following Peppy
# Learn about Arlan's trial from Dan Heng
# Pass on all the clues you learned to Asta
# Keep following Peppy
# Track down the suspicious crystals and find Arlan
# Defeat the mutant creatures
# Ask Arlan about the trial
# Keep interrogating Arlan to get to the truth behind the trials
# Help Dan Heng defeat the enemies
# Ask March 7th, who is sitting near the railway platform, for more details
# Track down the suspicious crystals and find Arlan

