===Find out more details from Asta{{subst:void|<!--200021102-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Master Control Zone|update|Asta seems to have encountered something worrying indeed.<br />She's waiting for you at "the old place." Head over and find out what has happened.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.WaitUIControllerClose",
	"UIControllerName": "PhoneNoticePage"
}</pre>
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.WaitUIControllerClose",
	"UIControllerName": "MobilePhonePage"
