;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Asta:''' Finally, you're here. This is urgent, so I'll cut to the chase &mdash; Arlan's disappeared.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Disappeared?
:'''Asta:''' Yes, I can't find him. He's not answering his messages or calls.
:'''Asta:''' In all the time since I took him in, this has never happened.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Have you checked the surveillance cameras?
:'''Asta:''' Of course! I didn't see him...
:'''Asta:''' Parts of the surveillance system were destroyed when the Legion invaded &mdash; it still hasn't been fully repaired. Maybe he took advantage of a blind spot.
:'''Asta:''' It's been thirteen hours since he last contacted me. He usually takes less than 13 seconds to reply to my messages!
:'''Asta:''' I looked everywhere and couldn't find him, so I checked the Security Department's work plan records. This is what I found!
:'''Asta:''' Look, at his last work objectives entry: "Of the heart. Of the mirror. Of the self." It's so strange...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The entries for last week are pretty odd too.
::'''Asta:''' ...Ahaha, d&mdash;don't worry about those.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sure is.
::'''Asta:''' I knew it. (Trailblazer), you think so too, right?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I think guys his age do tend to write like this.
::'''Asta:''' ...B&mdash;But he's never written poetry before!
:'''Asta:''' *sigh* I asked people in the Security Department, but none of them thought it was concerning. They said stuff like:
:'''Asta:''' "Brother Arlan is a grown man with his own plans!"
:'''Asta:''' I couldn't get them to listen at all, so I'm asking you for help.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You don't have any clues, how can I&mdash;
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Guys his age just need "alone time" sometimes!
::'''Asta:''' Why are you acting like those Security Department idiots!? Stop fooling around and help me!
:'''Asta:''' I have a secret weapon! Say hello to...
:'''Asta:''' Peppy!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Peppy?
:'''Asta:''' Mm-hmm, Peppy's my dog &mdash; Arlan's looked after him since he was a puppy. They're great friends.
:'''Asta:''' Peppy knows Arlan's scent &mdash; maybe he can track him down.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Then... am I still needed?
::'''Asta:''' Y&mdash;Yes! Think about it &mdash; if people see me, the acting lead researcher, searching for Arlan...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Then get Peppy to find Arlan.
::'''Asta:''' Peppy can't go alone. What if he gets lost too? And I can't go with him &mdash; if people see me, the acting lead researcher, searching for Arlan...
:'''Asta:''' Wouldn't that... Wouldn't that make Arlan look incompetent as head of the Security Department?
:'''Asta:''' ...Let's go together! Relax &mdash; Peppy doesn't bite.

