===Talk to Capote's fans{{subst:void|<!--200021112-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Master Control Zone|update|One of Capote's fans has a transcript that contains important clues.<br />Seeing as you can't get any useful information out of Professor Capote, keep digging from another angle.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Obtain {{Предмет|Master Capote's Fan Reply Card|20|x=1}})

;(Talk to Researcher)
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (This is the one who mentioned the transcript just now...)
:'''Seemingly Vigilant Researcher:''' Hey, you've been talking Master Capote's ear off this whole time. Do you... want to join the fan club?
:'''Ruminative Researcher after a Long Period of Thinking:''' I bet you do... You wouldn't have known about Captain Arlan's meeting with Master Capote unless you had an interest.
:'''Seemingly Vigilant Researcher:''' You even memorized the internal testing content for version 12.0 of Master Capote's Life Wiki!
:'''Ruminative Researcher after a Long Period of Thinking:''' You must be one of those super fans that stayed under the radar. *sigh* We've been careless.
:'''Less-Guarded Researcher:''' We're on the same side after all! Here, this is our latest welcome bundle for new members of the fan club, and I'll toss in an updated version of Master Capote's Life Wiki!
:'''Smiley Researcher:''' Aww... He looks really cool in the new limited-edition snapshots~
{{Dialogue End}}

