===Learn about Arlan's trial from Dan Heng{{subst:void|<!--200021116-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Base Zone|update|The last of the Legion have been cleared out, and it's now safe to ask about Arlan's situation.<br />Ask Dan Heng about Arlan's trial and his current whereabouts.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Obtain {{Предмет|Arlan's ID Pass|20|x=1}})

;(Talk to Dan Heng)
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...What are you doing here?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm here to protect a friend's secret.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm here to find a lost friend.
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...Then be careful. There are still Legion remnants in the area.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Arlan isn't here right now, so we need to step up the space station's security. Spare no effort and stay focused.
:'''Member of the Security Department:''' Yes, brother Dan Heng!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You saw Arlan?
::'''Dan Heng:''' Yes, he's with March.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Check you out, calling the shots...
::'''Dan Heng:''' *sigh* I'm only helping Arlan. You're here to look for him, right? He's with March.
:'''Dan Heng:''' But I suggest you don't bother him. He's given himself a personal trial.
:'''Thrilled Member of the Security Department:''' Brother Arlan's special trial? He's a man among men, a lion among tigers! He's already reached great heights, but still he wants to improve!
:'''Excited Member of the Security Department:''' That trial... I bet it's even more intense than physical training! And brother Arlan already challenges himself to the limit in that department &mdash; he runs 21,358 meters around the space station every day! An eagle among wolves! Always so hard on himself!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What kind of trial is it?
:'''Thrilled Member of the Security Department:''' I think it must have something to do with the mind. He probably found a waterfall and asked Ms. March to lower the temperature to freezing point!
:'''Excited Member of the Security Department:''' No way! Brother Arlan's trial wouldn't be as simple as just standing under a waterfall! I think he wants to learn fighting skills from Ms. March.
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...They're not correct, but not wrong either.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Arlan came to me to learn how to manage pressure from his boss.
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...So I sent him to March. If he can manage her, then he has nothing to fear.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He's a bear among horses!
::'''Thrilled Member of the Security Department:''' That might be a metaphor too far.
::'''Excited Member of the Security Department:''' Brother Arlan runs like a horse and fights like a bear. I think that's a great metaphor!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's pretty sadistic, Dan Heng.
::'''Thrilled Member of the Security Department:''' I think brother Dan Heng is pretty smart.
::'''Excited Member of the Security Department:''' Brother Arlan only has that one weakness in his armor, but he won't ignore it! He's too awesome for that!
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...Arlan and I decided to switch our assignments. He went with March to investigate a suspicious crystal, and I've taken up his patrol.
:'''Dan Heng:''' That's all.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did Arlan leave anything with you?
:'''Dan Heng:''' He gave me a pass for access across the space station while on patrol.
:'''Thrilled Member of the Security Department:''' I found a broken ceiling tile. This mark... it must be from where Brother Arlan smashed it down!
:'''Excited Member of the Security Department:''' Move aside. What kind of clue is that? This floor tile I found is way better! Look at the footprint &mdash; it's the right size, not to mention the angle of motion... This is proof of brother Arlan in combat!
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} "Of the mirror..." Did Arlan mention what that meant?
::'''Dan Heng:''' He said he read an anonymous handwritten journal in the space station &mdash; it contained 36 different strategies to do with managing pressure from one's boss.
::'''Dan Heng:''' It also contained some information on trials.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Firstly, the trial of the heart. One needs to acknowledge the pressure in one's heart, and only then can one face it.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Secondly, trial of the mirror. Like a mirror's reflection, one needs to personally experience the pressure others feel in a job in order to understand it.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Lastly, trial of the self. One places oneself within that pressure to complete a transformation.
::'''Dan Heng:''' I believe he came to me to complete the trial of the mirror.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Do you know why Arlan is undertaking this trial?
::'''Dan Heng:''' No. He didn't say, and I didn't ask.
::'''Thrilled Member of the Security Department:''' Brother Arlan doesn't need a reason to improve himself! You don't understand him at all!
::'''Excited Member of the Security Department:''' Brother Arlan is a fierce fighter with an eye for detail. If you don't understand his reason for doing things, maybe that's because you're too zoomed in.
::'''Thrilled Member of the Security Department:''' He's just staying ahead of the game is all! He's the space station's coldhearted hawk, the Security Department's alpha wolf!
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} I don't have any other questions.
::'''Dan Heng:''' If you want to find Arlan, just contact March.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Pass on all the clues you learned to Asta{{subst:void|<!--200021117-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Base Zone|update|You learned quite a few things from Dan Heng and the Security Department staff.<br />Give everything to Asta and see if she has any more ideas.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Asta)
:'''Asta:''' Job pressure... how to manage your boss...
:'''Asta:''' Arlan... I'm sorry. I never knew I was giving you so much pressure...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Calm down. Let's look at the clues first.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Maybe he doesn't mind...
:'''Asta:''' Mm... I need to feel the pressure he's feeling so I can understand what it's all about.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Arlan's ID Pass
::'''Asta:''' Ah, there's a photo of Peppy on the pass...
::'''Asta:''' I got Arlan to look after Peppy because I thought they got along... but was that giving him too much extra pressure?
::'''Asta:''' Maybe he printed out Peppy's picture as a way of forcing himself to remember his responsibility...
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Broken Ceiling Tile
::'''Asta:''' Look how smashed up this ceiling tile is... Arlan must have bottled up his frustration and had no way of releasing it &mdash; so he took it out on the monsters!
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Footprint
::'''Asta:''' It's Arlan's shoe size alright &mdash; and this actually came from a pair of shoes I bought for him.
::'''Asta:''' Maybe even these shoes are painful shackles for him...
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} Let's skip the clues for now.
::'''Asta:''' Yeah... We need to find Arlan quickly. I need to apologize to him in person!
::'''Asta:''' Peppy, let's get going.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Keep following Peppy{{subst:void|<!--200021118-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Supply Zone|update|Sniff sniff, sniff sniff.<br />Just showing Peppy a photo of March 7th is enough for it to accurately locate her. Feels like it's using more than just smell to recognize people...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''March 7th:''' *gasp* What a cute doggy! ...Oh, you're here too.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is Arlan not with you?
::'''March 7th:''' He was, but not anymore.
::'''March 7th:''' He wanted to go investigating on his own, so I let him~
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Nice of you to acknowledge the canine before me.
::'''March 7th:''' Hey! He's a new face, and you're not.
::'''March 7th:''' Huh, this little guy looks familiar... Ah! Are you Arlan's Peppy? Awwww I'm sowwie, your master isn't here. He's gone off to investigate~
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did he mention anything about a trial?
