:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why did you split up?
:'''March 7th:''' We were investigating suspicious crystals together, but he said it was all pointless if he couldn't "transform" himself...
:'''March 7th:''' I could tell he was giving himself a lot of pressure, so I gave him a suggestion~
:'''March 7th:''' I told him actions speak louder than words when you wanna prove yourself... I was just thinking out loud really, I had no idea what kind of trial he was doing.
:'''March 7th:''' But when he heard that, he said "Mr. Dan Heng was right."
:'''March 7th:''' And then he just left. I took a photo of him &mdash; he was doing one of those tough guy walks!
:'''March 7th:''' Come to think of it, maybe I shouldn't have left him alone. Take me with you if you're going after him!
----
