:'''Asta:''' Your ID pass!
::'''Asta:''' This isn't just any old station pass, is it? There's a very important photo on it!
::'''Asta:''' A photo of Peppy!
::'''Arlan:''' Lady Asta, I like Peppy a lot, so I...
::'''Asta:''' No, no, Arlan. You don't need to find excuses for your actions. *sigh* Maybe you've actually convinced yourself...
::'''Asta:''' The combination of your simulated conversations with Capote and the entry in your work log about playing holodisc with Peppy...
::'''Asta:''' It points to one thing: Me getting you to look after Peppy is the greatest source of your stress!
::'''Asta:''' Y&mdash;You even printed out a photo of Peppy to constantly remind yourself to look after him! *sniff*
::'''Asta:''' I know exactly what message you're trying to drill into yourself by sticking this photo onto your pass: "Arlan, taking Peppy out to play is an assignment from Lead Researcher Asta &mdash; you better throw that holodisc like it's a full-on discus! If you spare any effort... Lady Asta will find out and punish you terribly for all eternity!" *sniff*
::'''Arlan:''' M&mdash;My lady, don't you think that's a long thought to think...?
::'''Arlan:''' Lady Asta, please, I didn't do any of these trials because of you.
::'''Arlan:''' I always try to complete every assignment you give me, regardless of whether it's within my job description.
::'''Arlan:''' I... really like taking Peppy out to play.
::'''March 7th:''' Asta, I don't think Arlan is upset with you.
::'''Asta:''' But Arlan doesn't have any other bosses &mdash; who else would it be? March, he asked to accompany you so he could learn how to manage his stress, right?
::'''March 7th:''' Huh? Arlan wanted to go on assignments just to experience stress!?
::'''March 7th:''' Phew... Good thing I let him go alone &mdash; my calming influence would've ruined his training.
::'''March 7th:''' Hehe, guess I made the right decision after all.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Dan Heng was right.
::'''March 7th:''' What did he say? That I'm good at solving people's problems?
::'''Asta:''' Ugh, Arlan, all I want you to understand is how sincerely I'm reflecting on my actions. Please accept my apology!
::'''Arlan:''' But, my lady...
::'''Asta:''' Stop!
::'''Asta:''' Arlan, I understood the level of stress you're dealing with as soon as I saw this photo.
