:'''March 7th:''' Didn't I take that photo?
::'''Asta:''' I'm always giving you tasks and assignments, but I never actually see how you take to the battlefield...
::'''Asta:''' ...when I saw this photo, when I saw you fighting alone just now...
::'''Asta:''' I'm just sorry that I gave you the stress of all my private affairs on top of an already stressful job.
::'''Asta:''' Please forgive me, Arlan.
::'''Arlan:''' ...
::'''Arlan:''' My Lady, I... I'm very touched, but...
::'''Arlan:''' I started this trial because of Madam Herta.
::'''March 7th and Asta:''' What!?
::'''Arlan:''' Whenever she's back on the space station, Madam Herta assigns me things outside the Security Department remit.
::'''Arlan:''' Even if I dared to refuse, I wouldn't know how. She's just... too overbearing.
::'''Arlan:''' Whether it's helping her test some new specimen, or looking for ancient documents I've never even heard of...
::'''Arlan:''' ...Assignments like those were okay before the invasion, but now I need to focus on clearing out any last traces of the Legion.
::'''March 7th:''' Aha! So, you're trying to learn how to reject Herta, and then put it into practice!
::'''Arlan:''' Yes. I found an anonymous handwritten journal while I was cleaning up &mdash; it mentioned 36 different strategies for relieving pressure. That's where I read about the trials.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Of the heart, of the mirror, of the self...?
::'''Arlan:''' Yes. There were detailed notes, so... I wanted to give them a try.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Those trials really made Asta worry.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't just read any anonymous journal!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you really think it would help...?
::'''Arlan:''' I'm sorry, my lady... I didn't want to bother anyone, so I didn't mention it.
::'''Asta:''' So... you don't feel pressured around me?
::'''Arlan:''' I've never felt pressured around you, my lady.
::'''March 7th:''' Alright, alright &mdash; it's all a misunderstanding. You two should reflect on your actions!
::'''March 7th:''' Right, (Trailblazer)?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You need to talk to each other more.
:::'''March 7th:''' Yeah! See, the two of us would never have misunderstandings like this.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You both need to start saying what you're thinking.
:::'''March 7th:''' Yup! I always say what I'm thinking.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You both need to use your brains more.
:::'''March 7th:''' That's righ&mdash; Hey! This is supposed to be a happy moment!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Anyways, Dan Heng was right...
::'''March 7th:''' You keep saying that &mdash; what did Dan Heng even say...
::'''Arlan:''' ...Thank you for helping Lady Asta... and for coming to find me.
::'''March 7th:''' You're welcome! Although if you really wanna thank me... let me play holodisc with Peppy &mdash; pleaaaase~?
::----
{{Dialogue End}}

